{"id":"51544746a7792e0d","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-tree8-homogeneous-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree8 Homogeneous Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree8-homogeneous-tree — ZFC Tree8 Homogeneous Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree8-homogeneous-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree8-homogeneous-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree8-homogeneous-tree — ZFC Tree8 Homogeneous Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-tree-level.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree8-homogeneous-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree8-homogeneous-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree8-homogeneous-tree — ZFC Tree8 Homogeneous Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"da1d07bee8918b64\" href=\"?note=da1d07bee8918b64\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-tree-level.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-tree-level.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ff60400b5043f5c2\" href=\"?note=ff60400b5043f5c2\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,R_T,L,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(T,R_T,L,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11TreeAutomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11TreeAutomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (tree-automorphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ff60400b5043f5c2\" href=\"?note=ff60400b5043f5c2\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8HomogeneousTree}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8HomogeneousTree}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}homogeneous\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8HomogeneousTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R_T)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha,L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S(L,T,R_T,\\alpha)\\to\n\\forall s,t\\in L\\;\\exists\\pi\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11TreeAutomorphism}_S(\\pi,T)\\land\\pi(s)=t)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}homogeneous\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8HomogeneousTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R_T)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha,L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S(L,T,R_T,\\alpha)\\to\n\\forall s,t\\in L\\;\\exists\\pi\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11TreeAutomorphism}_S(\\pi,T)\\land\\pi(s)=t)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Homogeneity is transitivity of the automorphism action on every level of the sequence tree.</li>\n<li>层谓词与树谓词共享同一个受限前缀关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_T\">\\(R_T\\)</span>；不再经由把真类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq\">\\(\\subseteq\\)</span> 当关系参数的旧包装层。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-tree-level.md","status":"resolved","id":"da1d07bee8918b64","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-tree-level.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"ff60400b5043f5c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"ff60400b5043f5c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree11TreeAutomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (tree-automorphism predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-tree-automorphism.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,R_T,L,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11TreeAutomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8HomogeneousTree}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}homogeneous\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8HomogeneousTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R_T)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha,L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S(L,T,R_T,\\alpha)\\to\n\\forall s,t\\in L\\;\\exists\\pi\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11TreeAutomorphism}_S(\\pi,T)\\land\\pi(s)=t)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"R_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\subseteq","display":false}],"bytes":1552,"backlinks":[{"id":"ea5143d57d1e4522","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8HomogeneousTree}_S\\subseteq V$（其 Assertion 已要求每一层上自同构群传递，see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-tree8-homogeneous-tree.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3811","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-tree8-homogeneous-tree.md|58-df-zfc-tree8-homogeneous-tree]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d25b709595952a78","da1d07bee8918b64","ff60400b5043f5c2"]}